        "created_at": "2014-12-14T16:29:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Interesting that in the base game review he says he'd have preferred minis to the tokens, and then in the expansion review he complains that the minis aren't easy to distinguish and that unless you're going to paint the tokens are better. Make up your mind Tom! ;)</p>",
