        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "[quote=\"arenson9\"]\n\n<div class=\"bb-quote\"><b>Silverleaf wrote:</b><br /><blockquote class=\"bb-quote-body\">Interesting that in the base game review he says he&#39;d have preferred minis to the tokens, and then in the expansion review he complains that the minis aren&#39;t easy to distinguish and that unless you&#39;re going to paint the tokens are better. Make up your mind Tom! ;)\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nActually, I completely agree &nbsp;with that sentiment.Minis are more fun than tokens, but the unpainted minis are problematic such that the (beautiful!) tokens are better, even though they&#39;re just tokens.I had been starting to fear that my money spent on the painted tokens was a waste, but after playing with the painted minis at the tournament, I am _SO_ happy I could afford to purchase them.\n\n[/quote]\n\nThe pre-painted mini quality is fantastic. It is very high on my list of purchases once they hit the online store\n",
